WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
Open the line item.

00:02.400 --> 00:04.800
Tap Notes.

00:04.800 --> 00:09.390
Sales Notes hold sales context. Use them sparingly.

00:09.390 --> 00:12.950
Design Notes are for proof and artwork work.

00:12.950 --> 00:16.560
Production Notes are for after the proof is approved.

00:16.560 --> 00:23.190
Rush job? Add RUSH to the name. Tap the Rush button. Write the deadline in Production Notes.

00:23.190 --> 00:28.260
Every instruction goes in the Notes. Nothing in the Chat. Then save.
